ma</strong><br><br>Roman is an ordinary courier from not the most prestigious food delivery company. Lately, strange things have been happening in the city: animals have begun to behave differently and the people around them seem to be in a sinister conspiracy.<br><br>Will our protagonist be able to deliver the shawarma and still stay alive?<br><br></li><li><strong>White Blood</strong><br><br>Katya is discharged from the hospital after food poisoning. At first she doesn't feel unusual but soon notices that she can't eat shawarma! Strange changes will then begin to happen to her body...</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635980/extras/8cae2d741f6a9064919e1155754c9734.avif?t=1752412262\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An episodic visual novel within the same universe consisting of these genres: thrash, comedy, horror, thriller and some food horror/body horror<br></li><li>High-quality anime-style graphics combined with real-life photos and environments<br></li><li>An anxious dark atmosphere, which will be conveyed to the player through unusual sounds and visual effects<br></li><li>Screen resolution 1440x1080 px (4:3 aspect ratio)</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635980/extras/335841d5e16bb4059da1741a8fc90f04.avif?t=1752412262\" width=600 height=260 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635980/extras/ad10bbbf0c6097db80d99659f63dcc38.poster.avif?t=1752412262\" width=460 height=52 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635980/extras/ad10bbbf0c6097db80d99659f63dcc38.webm?t=1752412262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://s